71 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (Academic information in many universities and schools is spread across multiple platforms like email, learning systems, and messaging applications. This can make it difficult for students to manage assignments, deadlines, and important announcements, while lecturers may also face challenges in organizing course materials and communicating with students. UniSync was designed as a centralized learning management platform that combines features such as assignments, course materials, announcements, and grade tracking into one system. By organizing academic resources in a single platform, UniSync supports Sustainable Development Goal 4: Quality Education by improving access to organized digital learning resources and improving communication between students and lecturers.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
